 Resend DNS setup (one-time, required before emails go out)

  Since your domain isn't verified yet, do this in the Resend dashboard:

  1. Go to resend.com → Domains → Add Domain → enter theseerwithin.com
  2. Resend will give you 3 DNS records (2 DKIM + 1 SPF/Return-Path) to add in your DNS provider (Cloudflare, GoDaddy,     
  etc.)
  3. Once DNS propagates (~5–30 min), the domain turns green
  4. That's it — because all your addresses (hello@, evelyn@, marcus@) share the same domain, one domain verification      
  covers all of them. No separate sender identities needed per address.